# system-details screen-report-pager ---------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Inferred from origin/main (unreleased). The System Details$
# screen. Debian 13, as debian13. Treatment report-pager: one$
# line per section, an item opening the whole report in the$
# pager. It fits 80x24. The gallery runs no pager: the item says$
# what it would run.$
$
# System Details ###############################################$
$
# Summary ------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  OS and Kernel        Debian 13 (Trixie)$
   -  Host and IPs         web-01, 192.0.2.20/24$
   -  Users                alice$
   -  CPU and Load         4 CPUs, load 0.12$
   -  Disk                 11% of 38.6 GiB$
   -  Memory               30% of 3.8 GiB$
  [?] Last Login           Unknown$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Open                 The whole report in less$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

